The type who gets his engines firing
the more that people make fun of him!

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:23.290
The peanut gallery is so loud
I can't even think.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:25.330
I've decided we're going to
seal the deal right here and now.

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:26.380
Sounds great!

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:28.500
Let's get this over with and
hurry back to our planet!

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:29.630
Make preparations!

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:31.250
Wait, right here and now...?

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:32.580
Oh my gosh...
No way...<b></b>

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:34.250
I'll help out, too!

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:41.670
Wh-what is this?

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:44.170
Our love nest, what else?

00:12:44.170 --> 00:12:45.500
You damn traitor!

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:47.580
A love nest?

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:49.210
Hold on a minute!

00:12:49.210 --> 00:12:50.710
You mean to say
we're going to do it in THAT?!

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:51.580
Why of course.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:54.250
You can't just build a love hotel here!

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:55.670
It's totally outrageous!

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:56.790
Ew, grody!

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:58.210
Oh, shut up already!

00:12:58.210 --> 00:12:59.880
Child bearing is a holy rite in my culture!

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:02.380
I don't have to stand here and take flack
from a bunch of prissy girls like you!

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:05.210
How dare you!

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:06.500
Get lost, harlot!

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:08.130
Leave Mendo out of your dirty deeds!

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:10.170
Hold on, where do you think you're going?

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:11.790
Something suddenly came up...

00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:13.380
It's all ready to go!

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:16.830
Okay! Go ahead, princess!

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:19.960
All right! It's time to make babies.

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:22.920
You can't be serious!
Who does this sort of thing in public?!

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:25.920
No worries, we made it so nobody
could peek from the outside.

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:28.540
Just relax!
Nobody will be able to see us!

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:30.170
Well, I'm still gonna FEEL
all their eyes on me!

00:13:30.170 --> 00:13:32.790
How on earth am I supposed to
get in the mood like that?!

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:34.170
Have no fear, good sir.

00:13:34.170 --> 00:13:37.250
We've decorated the inside in a way
that's sure to get you in the mood.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:39.210
Th-that doesn't sound subtle...

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:40.170
<b>THWACK</b>

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:42.750
Jeez! Learn when to give up already!

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:44.630
Come! Let's shake the sheets!

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:46.000
W-wait just a minute!

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:47.960
Farewell, my sweet Mendo.

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:51.210
You're in the clutches of
some other woman now...

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:56.540
We're going to conceive the best children!

00:13:56.540 --> 00:13:57.580
Good luck, Princess!

00:13:57.580 --> 00:14:01.080
Aw hell! This is just the wooooooorst!

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:17.420
Are you really that opposed
to doing it with me?

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:19.250
Of course not, Miss Kurama.

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:24.080
I'm ready to be at your service whenever,
if you just pick a time and place.

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:25.290
Oh really?

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:30.380
Huh?

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:32.790
Then I pick here and now.

00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:39.580
Hold the phone!

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:40.460
Huh?

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:42.580
I'm not letting you take this any further!

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:45.170
Y-you damn pest!

00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:46.420
Get the hell out!

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:48.420
No can do!

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:50.540
The only one getting down
with you today is me, baby!

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:51.380
Give it a rest!

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:52.960
It's true, Princess Kurama!

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:55.880
Gramps? What are you doing here?

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:58.920
I hate to be the bearer of bad news,
but this is the truth.

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:02.460
The one who performed the kiss of awakening
on you was actually this numbsk-

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:04.580
The chivalrous Ataru Moroboshi!

00:15:04.580 --> 00:15:06.290
Get outta here with that hogwash!

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:07.790
Welp, I should get going...

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:09.500
Stay put, you!

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:12.210
You kissed me! Isn't that right?

00:15:12.210 --> 00:15:13.460
About that...

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:15.670
PLEASE TELL EVERYONE THAT IT WAS YOU!

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:17.580
Well, actually...

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:21.830
Please forgive me, Miss Kurama.

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:24.330
I never intended to deceive you.

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:27.170
I only did it because you deserve happiness!

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:31.290
You get it now? I'm your man!

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:33.130
Princess! We must adhere to custom!

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:35.460
C'mon, let's go to pound town!

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:35.460
<b>SNUGGLE</b>

00:15:35.630 --> 00:15:37.250
I've committed such a grave sin!

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:40.880
It doesn't even matter that I lied for
the sake of Miss Kurama's happiness!

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:44.080
Dude, you were just whining about how much
you didn't want to go through with it.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.170
The lady clearly has feelings for me!

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:48.130
And I'm trying to respect that!

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.540
Oh just drop the act!

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:51.830
If you really loved her then you'd have sealed
the deal regardless of the circumstances!

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:53.830
This is why I can't stand you lowly commoners!

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:56.710
How hard is it to tell the difference between
being in love and having no shame?!

00:15:56.710 --> 00:15:59.250
Kurama, baby!
We gotta uphold the tradition!

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:02.790
I say screw tradition!
Being true to your heart is more important!

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:03.750
Kurama, baby!

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:04.630
Miss Kurama!

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:05.710
C'mon! Do it with me!

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:07.250
No! Do it with me!

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:12.080
You know, I'm starting to sense
a similar pattern in their behavior...

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:16.460
I don't care if they're the same inside,
as long as the outside is different!

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:18.290
Good-looks are what I care about!

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:19.170
Yippee!

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:19.960
Oh c'mon!

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:21.330
You must not break tradition, princess!

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:24.290
Think about what will happen if you
decide not to abide by the rules!

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:25.830
What will happen?

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:33.000
I dunno.

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:34.790
What?! Get serious!

00:16:34.790 --> 00:16:37.330
Doesn't our tradition have
rules and punishments?

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:39.790
Well, to be honest,
I was only told

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:42.250
that we couldn't break the rules
by the previous elder...

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:43.710
So you don't know, then?

00:16:43.710 --> 00:16:44.710
Not the specifics.

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:48.000
But we should be able to find the answer
if we go through the data from the past.

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:49.830
Then hurry up and run a search!

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:54.920
What are you doing?

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:58.170
We're accessing the mother computer
on our home planet

00:16:58.170 --> 00:17:01.210
so we can seek knowledge from
the elders of previous generations.

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:02.790
Everything is ready to go!

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:06.710
We just need to go back to
the previous elder...

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:10.960
<b>Elder of the Previous Generation</b>

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:10.960
Whoa! Check it out!

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:12.460
That's a huge crow.

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:14.670
I am the elder of the previous generation.

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:16.540
He looks exactly the same to me...

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:18.210
We want to know what the
punishment and reasoning is

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:20.750
for the traditional kiss of awakening!

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:23.460
Well, ya see, I was just told by
the previous elder

00:17:23.460 --> 00:17:25.790
that it was a rule we couldn't break...

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:29.580
Hrmmm... I guess we need to
go back even further.

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:35.790
<b>Elder of Two Generations Ago</b>

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:34.210
I see. Well, I was just following
what the previous elder told me.

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:35.790
Hrm. Next.

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:38.790
<b>Elder of Three Generations Ago</b>

00:17:36.130 --> 00:17:38.000
I just did what the previous elder did.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:38.790
Next!

00:17:38.960 --> 00:17:40.960
You gotta ask the elder before me.

00:17:38.960 --> 00:17:40.960
<b>Elder of Four Generations Ago</b>

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:43.750
I'm starting to think that nobody knows...

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:44.960
Dagnabbit!

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:46.630
Then we're gonna go
all the way back to the first elder,

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:48.000
he should know everything!

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:51.750
<b>The First Elder</b>

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:51.750
I am the first elder of our tribe.

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:53.960
How many years into the past did you go?

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:55.630
About 120 generations ago.

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:57.920
Are you the one who established the tradition?

00:17:57.920 --> 00:17:59.460
I am, indeed.

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:04.170
However, I was determined to never explain
the reason behind its creation to anyone.

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:06.040
I wish to know why it was made!

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:08.460
I should have the right to know that much!

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:10.250
Very well.

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:13.880
Given how insistent you are,
I will share its origins with you.

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:18.500
It was many moons ago...
back when I was still a fledgling.

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:23.290
Our peaceful world was on the verge
of falling into the clutches of evil

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:25.540
after the princess had been captured.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:28.170
I was entrusted with the future of our tribe

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:32.880
and departed on a
boundless journey to rescue her.

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:38.710
During my adventure, I fought hard and
thwarted a great evil who tried to stop me.

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:43.710
Then a dazzling light led me to
the shore of a large lake.

00:18:43.960 --> 00:18:47.920
And that's where I found a lady crow
who was deep in slumber.

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:50.170
How beautiful...

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:55.830
I knew it was improper of me,
but I just couldn't help myself.

00:18:56.670 --> 00:18:59.330
And I kissed the sleeping beauty!

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:05.460
It must have been fated,
because the two of us were soon married.

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:11.290
<b>THE END</b>

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:18.710
I don't give a crap about
your sappy memories!

00:19:18.710 --> 00:19:21.040
Hurry up and explain the reason
you established the tradition!

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:22.380
Well, that is the reason.

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:26.960
I turned my young adventures into a tradition
so that I would never forget them fo-

00:19:28.170 --> 00:19:29.960
Th-that's so stupid!

00:19:30.710 --> 00:19:32.540
Ugh... what a waste of time.

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:37.540
So I've been living my whole life dedicated to
a tradition that was utterly pointless?!

00:19:38.790 --> 00:19:40.210
Princess...

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:49.790
What's the matter?

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:52.790
Oh nothing... I'm just shocked
that such an idiotic custom

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:56.250
managed to survive and get
passed down for 120 generations.

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:00.380
But isn't this good news?

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:03.580
Now the two of us can be married without
worrying about breaking any rules.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:06.290
Th-that's true...

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:08.500
Let's make beautiful children together.

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:09.540
Miss Kurama.

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:10.540
Hup!

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:14.580
Wah! It's dark! It's cramped! I'm scared!

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:17.830
It's dark! It's cramped! I'm scared!

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:20.080
Darling? What are you doing?

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:22.000
Wah! Let me outta here!
Take that! You buttmunch!<b></b>

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:23.830
Always acting like you're hot stuff!

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:27.000
Waaah! It's dark!

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:29.170
It's cramped! I'm scared!

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:32.960
So dark! So cramped! So scaaaaary!

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:34.670
Wait, Kurama. You're leaving?

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:37.040
I can't stand pathetic men like that.

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:40.750
I'm going to search for a hunk
with more muscle and mental fortitude.

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:42.960
You were really quick to change your tune

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:45.130
once you found out you didn't
have to follow tradition, huh?

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:48.630
Well, knowing that I'm free
to choose my own husband

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:50.460
has made me raise my standards.

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:52.630
I don't need to settle for anyone now.

00:20:52.630 --> 00:20:55.920
I'm going to search high and low
for a man who checks all the boxes!

00:20:55.920 --> 00:20:57.000
Seriously?

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:58.250
Please no!

00:20:58.420 --> 00:21:00.420
We don't even get paid overtime...

00:21:00.420 --> 00:21:02.040
We're back to square one.

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:04.130
That's the spirit, Princess Kurama!

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:06.380
The future for our clan will be very bright!

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:07.830
Come on, boys!

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:10.880
We're going to make up for lost time!

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:12.710
I'll find him!

00:21:12.710 --> 00:21:15.130
The absolute perfect man for me!

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:51.000
<b>The Glove of Love and Conflict</b>

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:51.000
<b>How I've Waited for You…</b>

00:22:46.250 --> 00:22:48.880
Next time on Urusei Yatsura.

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:50.670
Darling, you big dummy.
